       <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Go with knot.com it is good<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherineriverace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425100717,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RitvikSehgal","Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ffa4e6f9de7bff3b10aa361e5d61d6cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I used Wedding Wire. &amp;nbsp;Really nice templates and easy to use.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896776,"PostDate":1432227390,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I used Wedding Wire. \u00a0Really nice templates and easy to use.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421442569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1427826222","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.147.121.183","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34113b2bd961b05c0f897206b3bc71e7","RawContent":"I started with mywedding.com and ended up using weddingwire.com. \n\n\nI still have no colour scheme and am not sure I want anything other than neutral colours with maybe a pop of sparkle. Finding a specific colour scheme to match was not necessary (obviously) but I was able to find one with a calligraphy font I loved that matched our save the dates. \n\n\nI caution you to make your site name as short as possible. We had a longer one that didn&#039;t fit well in most STDs. Of coarse you could pay for your domain too if that&#039;s important to you. We decided to keep the $50-$60 and spend it on other (likely unnecessary) things lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1896846,"PostDate":1432275065,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I started with mywedding.com and ended up using weddingwire.com. <br><br>\nI still have no colour scheme and am not sure I want anything other than neutral colours with maybe a pop of sparkle. Finding a specific colour scheme to match was not necessary (obviously) but I was able to find one with a calligraphy font I loved that matched our save the dates. <br><br>\nI caution you to make your site name as short as possible. We had a longer one that didn't fit well in most STDs. Of coarse you could pay for your domain too if that's important to you. We decided to keep the $50-$60 and spend it on other (likely unnecessary) things lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;116\/st\/20160607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/1\/k\/bb99\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a>","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423105061,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.png?_r=1423373502","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":138,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.165.88.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2fcfdeb863c516094f5fe574e714b72c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Trying to this website &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.invity.com&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.invity.com&lt;\/a&gt;Lovely wedding themes are available.. best Wedding planning Ideas for Greating a website Online &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897171,"PostDate":1432550997,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0Trying to this website <a href='http:\/\/www.invity.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.invity.com<\/a>Lovely wedding themes are available.. best Wedding planning Ideas for Greating a website Online <\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/evincetech.com'>Web Development Company India<\/a>","Email":"jacky050279@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.165.88.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432380354,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Invity07","Id":283209,"Name":"Invity07","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":29,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":4,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
